    date "2022-04-25T18:13:20Z"
    title "Meet Donna | Autism Speaks"
    description "Donna was officially diagnosed with autism at the age of 4 but was fortunate enough to start early intervention at 2 &#189;. Because she was nonverbal at the time, her parents feared that Donna would not be able to express her thoughts and emotions with them. But with the support of her school and the Autism Speaks community, Donna is thriving.&#10;&#10;Donna and her family&#8217;s life changed when her insurance approved the use of a speaking device. Today, Autism Speaks has successfully advocated for autism insurance benefits covering 207 million people in all 50 states. Benefits enabling children, teens and adults with autism to obtain many of the therapies and services they need.&#10;&#10;To read more about Autism Speaks' science, advocacy and awareness &#38; acceptance efforts, or to read about some of our other exciting initiatives, please visit: www.autismspeaks.org."
