    date "2020-02-28T17:09:29Z"
    title "Adult Autism Assessment"
    description "I'm talking about what happens in an adult autism assessment and reflecting on my own experiences when I was assessed for autism and diagnosed as an adult. &#10;If you like my videos check out my blog &#128187; at http://www.purpleella.com&#10;&#10;If you'd like to book me to speak about autism at your workplace, school or conference find more information:  &#10;https://www.purpleella.com/public-spe...&#10;&#10;&#128156;Follow me on Twitter - &#10;https://twitter.com/Purpleella&#10;&#128156;Join me on Facebook -&#10; https://www.facebook.com/purpleella/&#10;&#128156; Follow me on Instagram - https://www.instagram.com/purpleellaa...&#10;&#10;If you want to contact me email me &#128241;ella@purpleella.com&#10;&#10;A little bit about me: &#10;Hi I'm Purple Ella and my family is an autism family with three out of five of us on the autistic spectrum. I also have a connective tissue disorder (hypermobile Ehlers-danlos syndrome). So life can be a challenge but also a lot of fun. &#10;&#10;Helpful links&#10;The National Autistic Society - http://autism.org.uk&#10;Hypermobility Syndromes Association - http://hypermobility.org"
