    id 75
    label "uKxj0ztxkQ0"
    step 0
    date "2022-04-02T02:30:13Z"
    title "Lets talk about Autism : An Autism awareness video for parents"
    description "Autism Spectrum Disorder (ASD) is one of the common childhood neuro-developmental disorders and results in speech delay and difficulty in relating to the people and world around.&#10;April is Autism Awareness month. World Autism Awareness day is observed every year on the 2nd of April with an intention to promote a better understanding about Autism.&#10;This video talks about some of the common signs of Autism spectrum Disorder.&#10;Understanding Autism better will pave  the way to inclusion in education, employment and the society. Early diagnosis followed by early intervention can yield excellent outcomes.&#10;&#10;Issued in Public interest by Developmental Paediatrics unit, Christian Medical College Vellore in an effort to promote awareness of Autism. &#10;&#10;#Autism #AutismAwareness&#10;&#10;Music credits: Downloaded from Pixabay- https://pixabay.com/music/build-up-scenes-inspiring-cinematic-background-music-for-videos-5717/"
