    title "10 Early Signs of Autism (UPDATED)"
    description "Update: This video is for educational purposes and intended for universities, libraries, general audiences, etc. THIS IS NOT a video targeted specifically to minors, nor do we collect data on minors.&#10;How do you know if your little one has autism? This video aims to help you discover answers and covers clinical examples found in many individuals with ASD (Autism Spectrum Disorder). Also as a side note, we mention echolalia in the speech example, but this particular example (even though Alistair repeated what he heard) was also an example of palilalia (constantly repeating), for more info about repetition of words, see here...https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=x7DEpUmJTbM&#10;&#10;https://www.patreon.com/autismfamily"
