    id 85
    label "1yva4RZW_s0"
    step 0
    date "2020-05-08T17:30:22Z"
    title "Autism diagnosis criteria: explained (DSM-5)"
    description "The autism diagnosis criteria are written for professional use and are therefore shrouded in mysterious and somewhat opaque language. In this video, I'm attempting to explain the DSM criteria for autism diagnosis (under the umbrella of Autism Spectrum Disorder) which is used in North America and parts of Europe (the ICD-11 is a more international version, but it is largely the same for the purposes of autism diagnosis)&#10;&#10;To read the DSM-5 criteria for yourself:&#10;https://www.cdc.gov/ncbddd/autism/hcp-dsm.html&#10;&#10;Getting an adult diagnosis of autism: is it worth it? https://youtu.be/SUJJ_7gMtDk&#10;Being autistic at uni: https://youtu.be/rBhmjFuJNpY&#10;&#10;&#128105;&#8205;&#128187;To join my Discord server for exclusive content, perks, community and giveaways, please go to my Ko-Fi page and sign up for the Monthly option: https://ko-fi.com/yosamdysam &#128105;&#8205;&#128187;&#10;(&#9749;If you like my content and just want to &#8220;tip&#8221; me, you can buy me a single Ko-Fi &#9749;)&#10;&#10;&#128256;All my autism videos in one handy playlist &#128256;: https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLfWrZJcC_lTAJvhgia_UqpidfyNARkPCN &#10;&#128109; Autism in women/girls playlist &#128109;: https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLfWrZJcC_lTDCKsfwEtLNWq96OgYHqA-b &#10;&#128038;My Twitter &#128038;: https://twitter.com/Samantha_Stein&#10;&#128247;My Instagram &#128247;: https://www.instagram.com/yosamdysam/&#10;&#9993; SIGN UP TO MY MAILING LIST &#9993;: https://www.subscribepage.com/yosamdysam"
