    id 100
    label "qWBfKb3u0OI"
    step 0
    date "2021-01-08T17:30:09Z"
    title "Autism: Eating Problems and their causes"
    description "&#9660;&#9660;&#9660; ABOUT ME &#9660;&#9660;&#9660;&#10;&#10;Hi, my name is Loren Snow and I&#8217;m autistic, ADHD, and have OCD.&#10;I speak publicly about these things on podcasts, radio, and to large and small crowds.&#10;I've taught thousands of students about autism, ADHD, and mental health; and I regularly teach courses to parents and autistic people.&#10;&#10;I decided to make Autism Academy as I see many autistic people struggling to understand themselves, and many parents lost on what to believe. &#10;I think Autism Academy can help people to understand themselves and encourage others to learn about autism.&#10;&#10;&#9660;&#9660;&#9660; HOW TO BOOK ME &#9660;&#9660;&#9660;&#10;&#10;Want to book me for an event or to talk about specific issues you're having?&#10;&#10;1-2-1 MENTORING:&#10;In-person or phone chat about you or your child's needs. It can be about the challenges you have both at home and in school as well as specific difficulties such as sensory needs and meltdowns. &#10;Find out more here: https://www.LorenSnow.com/121-advice&#10;&#10;TRAINING:&#10;I regularly deliver training to parents, autistic people, and businesses; through workshops, presentations, and informal discussions about the challenges your staff face. &#10;Find out more here: https://www.LorenSnow.com/training&#10;&#10;PUBLIC SPEAKING:&#10;Whether on radio or TV, recording or live. I can talk to both audiences large and small and have delivered for groups of 6 up to audiences of over a hundred. &#10;Find out more here: https://www.LorenSnow.com/public-speaking&#10;&#10;https://www.LorenSnow.com/services&#10;&#10;&#9660;&#9660;&#9660; SOCIAL MEDIA &#9660;&#9660;&#9660; &#10;&#10;Website - https://www.LorenSnow.com&#10;Facebook - https://www.facebook.com/AutismSpectrumAcademy&#10;Twitter - https://twitter.com/AutismSAcademy&#10;&#10;&#9660;&#9660;&#9660; COPYRIGHT &#9660;&#9660;&#9660;&#10;&#10;Copyright: (CC BY-NC-ND 4.0)&#10;&#10;&#10;Music by: www.bensound.com"
