    title "Early Autism Signs | INCLUDING FOOTAGE | 0-3 years old | Signs of Autism in Toddlers"
    description "These are the early autism signs I saw in my autistic son. He was diagnosed at age two and is nonverbal. &#10;Please know that these are just some of the signs I saw in my son that made me look for support. &#10;&#10;Please know that just because your child does one or two of these thing it does not mean they have autism. Make sure to look for help from a pediatrician or specialist dr. &#10;&#10;#autismsigns #earlysignsofautism #autismtoddlersigns&#10;&#10;&#10;OUR AUTISM STORY (autism signs and diagnosis)&#10;&#10;https://youtu.be/HBX7orF5jQU&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;Exclusive merchandise only at https://rocknstims.com&#10;&#10;Join our Membership to support our channel:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC1e4LX2OCN3x1azKURaqKLQ/join&#10;&#10;&#10;WE GOT A PO BOX!! &#10;PO BOX 60371&#10;Las Vegas, NV 89160&#10;&#10;__________________________________________________________&#10;Harkla:&#10;https://harkla.co/?rfsn=4876231.9c052d&#10;Use discount code Rocknstims for 10%&#10;__________________________________________________________&#10;CHECK OUT OUR :&#10;COMMUNICATION PLAYLIST &#10;https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLPmeKRUvQ8Rq0zTrCg0eFIYdK76qziU_r&#10;&#10;&#10;MORNING ROUTINE PLAYLIST&#10;https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLPmeKRUvQ8Rq0zTrCg0eFIYdK76qziU_r&#10;&#10;&#10;PODCAST&#10;https://open.spotify.com/show/4DR75u5vE2hPakqlJfTwWv&#10;https://anchor.fm/ROCKNSTIMS&#10;__________________________________________________________&#10;WE CREATED A PATREON!&#8252;&#65039;&#10;Thanks for all the support... we really love making autism videos for other families that can relate! You will find more behind the scenes, daily life, tips and Q&#38;A&#8217;s on our Patreon page!"
