    description "In honor of World Autism Awareness/Acceptance Week, we're going to cover some misconceptions many have about autism or autistic people.&#10;&#10;I highly encourage you to check out the live stream collabs that have been going on over on my Instagram for this week: https://www.instagram.com/stephanie_bethany/channel/&#10;&#10;#WAAW2021 #WorldAutismAwareness #AutismAcceptance&#10;&#10;Reference/Further Reading:&#10;https://www.autism.org.au/what-is-autism/common-misconceptions/&#10;https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC2664646/#:~:text=In%20the%20DSM%2DII%2C%20autism,II%20work%20conducted%20by%20Kolvin&#10;&#10;MERCH: stephanie-bethany.myteespring.co&#65279;&#10;&#10;Become a channel member!: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCpSxFn3gz2xMbof_EDumN3A/join&#10;&#10;Follow me on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/stephaniebethanyyt&#10;&#10;Support my channel and become a Patron!: https://patreon.com/stephaniebethany&#10;&#10;Sensory Tiles: &#10;https://cobyandbam.com/?ref=stephanie [be sure to use code stephanie783 at checkout for 20% off!] &#10;-Please note that if you do buy through the link and use my code, I will receive a small commission at no cost to you. Thank you for supporting the channel!-"
