    title "Decoding Autism - A Documentary | #AutismAwarenessMonth #VishayKhol"
    description "As April is #AutismAwarenessMonth, we bring you a documentary that shows what the life of an Autistic person looks like. Is Autism curable? What are the symptoms? Through this documentary, we've tried to answer these questions and more. We are extremely thankful to the families for sharing their experiences. We hope this attempt helps to spread more awareness about Autism. For more such videos Subscribe to #VishayKhol. &#10;&#10;Tumcha Vishay kiti Khol ahe? Visit https://bhadipa.com/ for more videos and events!&#10;https://www.facebook.com/BhaDiPaVishayKhol&#10;https://www.twitter.com/BhaDiPa&#10;https://www.instagram.com/BhaDiPaVishayKhol&#10;&#10;Bharatiya Digital Party [Comedy]&#10;https://www.youtube.com/c/bharatiyadigitalparty&#10;Bharatiya Touring Party [Travel]&#10;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCeHBtWLeV3wLJT3B_8Oq0TQ&#10;&#10;Featuring : &#10;&#10;Anjali Joshi, occupational therapist&#10;anjalijoshi.ot@gmail.com&#10;&#10;Kabir Kumtha&#10;Creative Colleague, Kabir's Kreations&#10;Parul Kumtha&#10;Founding Trustee, Forum for Autism (FFA)&#10;Consultant, Adult Support Kendra (ASK)&#10;Anand Kumtha&#10;Core Group Parent, Forum for Autism&#10;Consultant, Adult Support Kendra (ASK)&#10;&#10;Atharva Ravikiran Saurkar &#10;Tejashri Ravikiran Saurkar &#10;Ravikiran Purushottam Saurkar&#10;&#10;Forum for Autism&#10;forumforautism@gmail.com&#10;forumforautism.org&#10;&#10;Adult Support Kendra (ASK)&#10;ask@yashcharitabletrust.org&#10;yashcharitabletrust.org&#10;&#10;Credit List - &#10;Writer, Director - Somesh Sahane &#10;Editor - Gaurav Khairnar &#10;Cinematographer - Ajinkya Khadpekar &#10;Programming Head - Somesh Sahane &#10;Creative Producer - Paula McGlynn &#10;Production - Kedar Naidu &#10;Production runner - Mangesh Jadhav &#10;Social Media - Pooja Parab, Tanvi Kulkarni, Shreyash Keskar &#10;Creatives - Prajakta Newalkar &#10;Subtitles - Siddhi Jalgaonkar&#10;Transportation - Shubh Tours And Travels"
