    description "Decreasing the symptoms and suffering of children with Autism is the goal of this video. Improving an ASD symptom score by even 10% can make all the difference for some families. This video discussed research showing that changes in diet can lead to a significant improvement in ASD symptoms.&#10;&#10;Autistic children often have trouble adjusting to new food flavors and textures. This is one of the few times I recommend Keto shakes &#38; soups to use as you transition them to a keto diet. Keto Chow has a large assortment of flavors and very clean ingredients. &#10;Find them here: http://bit.ly/KetoChowDiscount&#10;&#10;Research: &#10;Gut-Brain Axis:  https://bmcpediatr.biomedcentral.com/articles/10.1186/s12887-019-1896-6&#10;Carnitine &#38; ASD:  https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/full/10.1002/bies.201700012&#10;Carnitine &#38; ASD:  https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/s10803-004-5283-1&#10;Sialic Acid &#38; Brain Dev:  https://www.researchgate.net/publication/227859674_Sialic_Acid_Is_an_Essential_Nutrient_for_Brain_Development_and_Cognition&#10;Sialic Acid in Breastmilk/Formula:  https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/8114778/&#10;KETO Diet Improves ASD:&#160; https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/29421589/&#10;High-Fat, Gluten-Free Improves ASD Sxs:&#160; https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/28808808/&#10;Vit D + DHA for ASD:&#160; https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/30607782/ &#10;VitaminD &#38; ASD:&#160; https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC4998950/ &#10;Vit D &#38; ASD:&#160; https://acamh.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/abs/10.1111/jcpp.12652 (retr)&#10;AVOID Oxalates:  https://www.ejpn-journal.com/article/S1090-3798(11)00154-1/abstract&#10;&#10;Daily MINERALS:  http://bit.ly/MineralFix (Discount Code applied)&#10;LIES MY DOCTOR TOLD ME:  https://amzn.to/2YxwHK9&#10;&#10;LIVER Supplement:  http://bit.ly/AncestOrgs (Discount code = KENTEN)&#10;Eat REAL SALT:   http://bit.ly/RealSalts&#10;&#10;&#11093;  Subscribe to this channel to enjoy Weekly Videos  &#