    date "2021-05-19T02:30:06Z"
    title "What it actually means to be on the autism spectrum | Love On The Spectrum"
    description "Young people talk about the common misconceptions that people have about what it means to live with autism. #LOTSAU&#10;Subscribe now: http://ab.co/subscribe&#10;___________________________________________&#10;&#10;In search of love, young adults on the autism spectrum navigate the unpredictable and complicated world of dating and relationships.&#10;&#10;Stream now on ABC iview: http://ab.co/LoveOnTheSpectrum&#10;___________________________________________&#10;&#10;Are there misconceptions about autism?&#10;There are definitely these misconceptions that because I'm autistic I'm going to be excellent at math. I hate math! I love English. And as soon as I tell someone I'm autistic they try to get me to give them the square root of pi. &#10;What do you think about the misconception that people on the spectrum don't have empathy?&#10;I've never met someone on the spectrum who was unable to empathise with a person."
