    date "2012-09-21T18:25:03Z"
    title "Playing with Toys | Real Look Autism | Babble"
    description "See Babble's Top 30 Autism Spectrum Blogs:&#10;http://www.babble.com/baby/baby-development/top-30-autism-spectrum-blogs/&#10;&#10;Playing with Toys:&#10;Marcus is a loving and affectionate boy who is on the autism spectrum. He likes playing by himself but gets frustrated at not being able to communicate. His therapist teaches Marcus' grandmother simple techniques to engage with Marcus and play more interactively.&#10;&#10;Follow Babble Video on Twitter: https://Twitter.com/BabbleVideo&#10;&#10;SUBSCRIBE: http://bit.ly/15AK9YA&#10;&#10;About Babble:&#10;Welcome to Babble's YouTube Channel, a video destination for a new generation of parents. We are dedicated to telling the truth about parenting, to bypass the clich&#233;s and dig into the magical and maddening reality.&#10;&#10;Connect with Babble Online:&#10;Visit Babble WEBSITE: http://bit.ly/16NFw0K&#10;Like Babble on FACEBOOK: http://bit.ly/11sKy2x&#10;Follow Babble on TWITTER: http://bit.ly/14cmjpQ&#10;Add Babble on GOOGLE+: http://bit.ly/Xvw4Zc&#10;Follow Babble on INSTAGRAM: http://bit.ly/10t077S&#10;&#10;Playing with Toys | Real Look Autism | Babble&#10;http://www.youtube.com/user/babble"
