    id 285
    label "yjbWcNxgu0I"
    step 0
    date "2021-11-13T02:23:33Z"
    title "I have  Autism | AUTISM IN GIRLS"
    description "In this week's video Olivia Hops talks about why telling people they have &#34;high&#34; functioning Autism isn't a compliment, but a back-handed one! &#10;&#10;&#10;I go over why the &#34;high&#34; and &#34;low&#34; functioning labels don't work. Autism isn't a linear line, but a giant circle with endless possibilities! Just because someone may appear &#34;high&#34; functioning, it doesn't mean they don't have struggles. It doesn't make them any &#34;less&#34; Autistic. It just means they're better at hiding their autistic traits to appear &#34;normal.&#34;&#10;&#10;&#10;If you like this video, please SUBSCRIBE and don't forget to press the bell &#128276;, &#128077;like, comment and share. Stay safe and God Bless!&#10;---------------------------&#10;&#9654;&#65039; Please Subscribe: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCCWryFHAlROoL-upxgaF_4w&#10;---------------------------&#10;&#9654;&#65039; For Business and Other Inquiries: olivia@autisticallyme.com&#10;---------------------------&#10;&#9654;&#65039; keep In Touch:&#10;&#8226; Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/oliviahops/&#10;---------------------------&#10;&#9654;&#65039; Small Business:&#10;&#8226; Shop at my small business for all your Cookie Dough needs! www.UnbakedBar.com&#10;---------------------------&#10;&#9654;&#65039; Other Contents:&#10;&#8226; I was Groomed as an Autistic Teen: https://youtu.be/dnHlpkAM9IA&#10;&#8226; How Autism Affects Mental Health: https://youtu.be/PXT0elZsmyY&#10;&#8226; Autism and Relationships Part 2: https://youtu.be/sKIrX3pBvV4&#10;&#8226; 9 Childhood Autistic Traits in Girls: https://youtu.be/YLiOARAtFNs&#10;---------------------------&#10;#autistictraits #autismingirls #OliviaHops #autismgirls #autismspectrum #femaleswithautism #autisticfemales #asdtraits # aspergers #autism #autistic #asd"
