    title "Autism Goes To College Trailer | Can people with autism go to college?"
    description "Follow 5 students on the autism spectrum as they take us into their dorm rooms and classrooms to show us how they're doing college.  This is the trailer for the feature documentary film AUTISM GOES TO COLLEGE, a first of its kind look at how students on the autism spectrum are fairing at the country's colleges and universities.  &#10;&#10;If you're trying to figure out if college is right for you or your loved one with autism, this film offers many insights from a broad range of students with invisible disabilities.  Is going to college possible if you have autism?  Are there resources available to college students with autism?  Do college professors support neuro-diversity in their classroom?  These questions and more are explored in this film."
