    id 315
    label "SxBj73fxl-8"
    step 0
    date "2020-11-08T09:30:04Z"
    title "My Autistic Son Through the Years - First Signs of Autism and Speech Development"
    description "This week I'd like to show you some videos of Dylan from 0 to 10 years old. You'll be able to see Dylan's first signs of Autism and also how his speech developed over the years. When Dylan was first diagnosed, I always wanted to see what an 8-year-old or a 10-year-old looked like, so I hope this video will help you in some way. &#10;&#10;&#10;You can find more of Dylan's gaming videos on his channel:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC3cQhpzCnV6Qh3pnItibY8A/featured&#10;&#10;If you're interested to find out more about Dylan's development check out this video:&#10;https://youtu.be/UzVWsKUgTuE&#10;&#10;If you're here because of a recent diagnosis, make sure you check out my tips on what you should do after a diagnosis:&#10;https://youtu.be/8FVOQpIZV7U&#10;&#10;&#10;If you're new to my channel, welcome to the family and thank you for watching our video. Here's a little bit about me, I am a wife, a mother of three beautiful children, and a former actress. Following my eldest son (Dylan)'s diagnosis of ASD, I threw myself into knowing all there was to know about Autism and how to help him. After 6 years of research, I wrote my first book 'Coming Home to Autism', with my friend and speech therapist, Rhian Grounds. My mission is to help support and inspire parents of special needs children!&#10;________________________________________________________________&#13;&#10;Social media:&#13;&#10;Instagram - http://instagram.com/taraleniston&#13;&#10;Facebook - http://facebook.com/cominghometoautism&#13;&#10;Website - http://cominghometoautism.com/&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Business enquiries:&#13;&#10;info@cominghometoautism.com&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Video Producer: &#13;&#10;Tiara Westlake https://www.kamukami.com/&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Music:&#13;&#10;Audio Library&#10;__________________________________________________________________"
