    title "Marvelous Max - Autism Awareness for Kids"
    description "Marvelous Max is a 3 minute animated video for Primary School kids. The aim of the video is to create more awareness of autism spectrum disorder.&#10;&#8203;&#10;The Marvelous Max program is a free resource for all schools across Australia.  &#10;&#10;Once your school registers, you will then gain access to the downloadable video file and teacher&#8217;s kit. The teacher&#8217;s kit comes with a lesson plan, questions to ask the kids after watching the video and facts about Autism Spectrum Disorder. It also comes with student surveys and a reflection task for students in years 5 &#38; 6.&#10; &#10;To register click on link below.&#10;&#10;Website:&#10;&#10;www.marvelousmax.com.au&#10;&#10;Like us on Facebook&#10;&#10;www.facebook.com/marvelousmax.com.au/&#10;&#10;Follow us on Twitter:&#10;&#10;https://mobile.twitter.com/MarvelousMax_HQ&#10;&#10;Follow us on Instagram:&#10;&#10;https://www.instagram.com/marvelousmax_hq"
