    description "Come see the very early autism signs we saw in our baby, 0-12 months old! Our son was diagnosed with level 3 autism at 2.5yrs old, and these were the red flags we saw when he was a very young infant!&#10;#autismearlysigns #autismsigns #autismbaby&#10;&#10;&#10;Come join our Autism family, follow our real life vlogs and create acceptance.&#10;We are the Otter&#8217;s, we are young parents to the most gorgeous baby boy, Jacob (3yrs) and the most beautiful baby girl, Jazz (1yr).  We love to record our memories as an Autism family and all the adventures that we take part in, so go click that beautiful, red subscribe button&#8230; you know you want to!&#10;&#10;SEE MORE OF US HERE - https://www.patreon.com/aussieautismfamily&#10;&#10;Social media: &#10;Our Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/aussieautismfamily&#10;Our Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/AussieAutismFamilyYoutube&#10;&#10;EARLY AUTISM SIGNS - 2YRS OLD https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TMaCC-pdpmE&#38;t=37s&#10;EARLY AUTISM SIGNS - 3YRS OLD https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_gba3JNKi5c&#38;t=6s"
