    label "QK8oIkG0p6o"
    step 0
    date "2021-04-27T04:35:51Z"
    title "Smarter in Seconds: Truths about Autism #shorts"
    description "#SmarterInSeconds: Autism! Featuring @transteachertales, @autienelle, @fidgets.and.fries, &#38; @autiartistjess on Instagram! Autism isn&#8217;t a problem, ableism is. #RedInstead &#10;&#10;April is #AutismAcceptanceMonth a necessary shift from #AutismAwarenessMonth. Why? Because it&#8217;s time to ACCEPT Autistic people as they are. Neurotypical people are already accommodated in society, it&#8217;s time for Neurodiversity to be embraced too. &#10;&#10;Instead of supporting an organization that has the widespread scorn of autistic adults or focusing on the relatives and caretakers let&#8217;s support actually autistic people whether them self describe as &#8220;Autistic,&#8221; &#8220;Auties,&#8221; &#8220;people with Autism,&#8221; etc. Many thanks to Dylan Kapit for all the lessons you&#8217;ve taught me!&#10;&#10;&#10084;&#65039; Follow on Instagram &#10084;&#65039;&#10;@AutisticSelfAdvocacy&#10;@The.Autisticats&#10;@TheAutisticLife&#10;@UnnMasked&#10;@TheNeurodiverseOT&#10;@MyAutisticSoul&#10;@Fidgets.And.Fries&#10;@AutiArtistJess&#10;@Autienelle&#10;@TransTeacherTales&#10;@ActuallyAutisticTikToks"
