    id 370
    label "TMaCC-pdpmE"
    step 0
    date "2019-07-10T00:32:30Z"
    title "AUTISM EARLY SIGNS | Two Years Old (Incl. Footage)"
    description "PLEASE NOTE:  It is so different for every child and it does not necessarily mean your child has autism if they exhibit any of these behaviours.&#10;I have made a video of all the signs of autism we saw in our 1 year old toddler! He has recently been diagnosed with level 3 Autism and here is footage of his early signs.&#10;Please take into consideration that some of these &#34;signs&#34; are normal toddler behaviours, it does not necessarily mean that your toddler has Autism if they are exhibiting these behaviours. &#10;&#10;Come join our growing Otter family, subscribe to our channel and be a part of all our upcoming adventures. &#10;We are the Otter&#8217;s, we are young parents to the most gorgeous baby boy, Jacob (born 05.01.17) and are currently pregnant with baby #2! We love to record our memories as a family and all the adventures that we take part in, so go click that beautiful, red subscribe button&#8230; you know you want to!&#10;&#10;WATCH MORE OF US HERE - https://www.patreon.com/aussieautismfamily&#10;&#10;Social media: &#10;Jess&#8217; Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/jessmadeline93/?hl=en &#10;Our Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/Otterlyinlove/?ref=aymt_homepage_panel &#10;Our Twitter: https://twitter.com/jessholmes6 &#10;&#10;OUR GENDER REVEAL- https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Hp0vZNCuM0U&#38;t=1s &#10;PREGNANCY ANNOUNCEMENT - https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XtAcPvXkvKw &#10;TELLING HUSBAND IM PREGNANT - https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fKAglRxRWOk&#38;t=1s"
