    title "Sensory box for kids with autism With Dr Himani Narula"
    description "This video is about how to make a sensory box for kids with autism. Dr Himani Narula explains the different items that can be put in a sensory box to help kids with autism spectrum disorder (ASD) calm down and focus. She recommends using things like sand, water, rice, and beads to stimulate the senses. Watch the video to learn more about how to create a sensory box that can help your child cope with ASD&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;#specialneeds #specialneedskids #autismsupport #autismspeaks #facebooklive #youtubelive #autismspectrumdisorder #continuakids"
