    date "2022-06-10T23:00:03Z"
    title "Ultimate Autism Survival Kit (YOU NEED)"
    description "My personal ultimate Autism Survival Kit you need to see.&#10;Brillia https://www.discoverbrillia.com [CODE: ASPIE15 for 15% OFF!] For shipments to the UK please email info@discoverbrillia.com&#10;&#10;Autism has its struggles, however, to help with these issues that autism throws at us during everyday life I have some must-have essential items that I have to carry with me every day. &#10;&#10;My Kit:&#10;&#10;1. AirPods (noise cancelling headphones)&#10;Because autism comes with sensory processing issues, I cannot go without my noise cancelling headphones to block out sound. &#10;&#10;2. Brillia&#10;Brillia is a homeopathic medicine you can get to help with anxiety and irritability. This is perfect for Autism and ADHD. It is also prescription free and super natural. &#10;&#10;3. iPhone / iPad &#10;Organisation and remembering is not a strong point for me, and others on the spectrum share this issue. So I use my iPhone and iPad to help organise my life with apps that help remind me and help me stay on task. &#10;&#10;4. Sunglasses&#10;Because autism hand sensory processing disorder have such a strong relationship it is so helpful to have sunglasses with me to block out some light and also hide my eyes when talking to people. &#10;&#10;5. Autism Alert Card&#10;You never know when you will be in a situation where you need to explain to someone that you are autistic without having to verbally say it. This card does exactly that! &#8594; http://bit.ly/AutismAlertCard&#10;&#10;Please let me know what you think, and if you have anything you would add to this list in the comments below. Follow @theaspieworld for more autism content &#10;&#10;LINKS:&#10;&#10;Katharine Lilley - What's In My Bag?! | Autism And Anxiety Edition | Survival Kit! | Autistic and Anxious: https://youtu.be/AgVfNbE3WFs&#10;&#10;Craig Thomson - Autism Survival Manual - Personal Survival kit: https://youtu.be/p0Il7NHQRsM&#10;&#10;Be Prepared: Carry an Autism Survival Kit - Autism Society of NC - https://www.autismsociety-nc.org/be-prepared-carry-an-autism-survival-kit/&#10;&#10;How to Build an Autism Kit for On-the-Go - https://blog.stageslearning.com/blog/how-to-build-an-autism-kit-for-on-the-go&#10;&#10;HASH TAGS:&#10;#Autistic   #AspergerSyndrome #ASD"
