    date "2019-09-16T19:00:06Z"
    title "EARLY AUTISM SIGNS IN BABIES (actual footage)"
    description "Autism does NOT have a look but this is what Autism looks like to us in our autistic toddler Liam. Our 1 year old toddler has been diagnosed as moderately to severely autistic so here are the early signs of autism in 20 month old toddlers. The signs of autism in babies or toddlers aren't always easy to tell but if you are concerned or unsure about your child, please contact their physician. Early intervention is key&#10;&#10;Signs of Autism In Toddlers &#128073; https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jgGHHmM7ZvM&#38;t=497s&#10;&#10;Join Our Exclusive Community! &#128073;https://www.patreon.com/ourlandingcrew&#10;&#10;Autism Support Bands &#38; Merch &#128073; http://ourlandingcrew.storenvy.com/&#10;&#10;Join us on LIVESTREAM  &#128073;https://www.younow.com/OurLANDingCrew/channel&#10;Instagram &#128073;https://instagram.com/ourlandingcrew&#10;FB &#128073; https://www.facebook.com/ourlandingcrew&#10;Patreon &#128073;https://www.patreon.com/ourlandingcrew&#10;&#10;We are a fun family channel who do daily vlogs, shopping vlogs, cleaning, homeschooling, and autism showing what a real large family looks like! &#10;&#10;What I Use To Create My Videos&#128071;&#10;Apple iMac &#128073;https://amzn.to/2OhJLxe&#10;Apple MacBook Pro &#128073;https://amzn.to/2FlvUTn&#10;Manfrotto Tripod &#128073;https://amzn.to/2OhJLxe&#10;Joby GorillaPod &#128073;https://amzn.to/2ufzCaU&#10;Sony RX100v &#128073;https://amzn.to/2ufFC3p&#10;Canon Rebel t6i &#128073;https://amzn.to/2ufFC3p&#10;GoPro Hero 5 &#128073;https://amzn.to/2TKLGQT&#10;Limo Softbox Lighting &#128073;https://amzn.to/2FoggHc&#10;[Amazon Affiliate Links]&#10;&#10;Kids Channel &#128073;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCYCNWzdK_343x8jktTRJlKw&#10;Amazon Store &#128073; https://www.amazon.com/shop/ourlandingcrew&#10;&#10;Stephanie (Mom), Lonnie (Dad), Danielle (15), Lonnie Jr (13), Noah (12), Lex (3), Liam (1), and Baby Penelope&#10;&#10;&#10084; We would love to hear from you &#10084; &#10;&#10;Our LANDing Crew&#10;P.O. Box 862 &#10;Pinellas Park, FL 33781&#10;&#10;!KiDS SOCiAL MEDiA!&#10;Lonnie's Instagram &#128073; https://www.instagram.com/lonniewp&#10;Danielle's Instagram .&#128073; https://www.instagram.com/raining_pastels"
