    id 387
    label "138y6mtgll8"
    step 0
    date "2021-02-26T20:00:16Z"
    title "Sias Music: The Trap of Symbolic Autistic Representation"
    description "#SiaMusic #Ableism #Autism&#10;&#10;Sia's recently directorial debut Music has received a ton of critism from the autistic community and has been critically reviled... yet was also nominated for two Golden Globes, including Best Comedy.  Considering the very wide reception of the film, let's take a nuanced look on the controversies around the film.&#10;&#10;&#10004; SUPPORT &#10004;&#10;Patreon:  https://www.patreon.com/jessiegender&#10;PayPal:  https://paypal.me/jessiegender&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203; &#10;&#10;&#10004; CRITISMS OF BLACKFACE IN SIA'S MUSIC &#10004;&#10;https://meaww.com/maddie-ziegler-racist-blackface-music-sia-autism-movie-internet-reactions&#10;https://www.pinknews.co.uk/2021/02/15/sia-music-movie-maddie-ziegler-blackface/&#10;https://www.hitc.com/en-gb/2021/02/14/sia-blackface-controversy-explored-twitter-reacts-to-her-movie-music/&#10;&#10;&#10004; OTHER REFERENCES AND READINGS &#10004;&#10;https://www.washingtonpost.com/local/the-very-real-very-painful-reasons-the-autistic-community-demanded-two-restraint-scenes-be-removed-from-sias-new-film-music/2021/02/10/5486fb1a-6bca-11eb-9ead-673168d5b874_story.html&#10;https://www.themarysue.com/interview-director-ben-lewin-please-stand-by-dakota-fanning/&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jLqtD4l3Gag&#38;list=WL&#38;index=1&#10;https://www.rollingstone.com/movies/movie-features/sia-music-movie-review-controversy-1125125/&#10;https://people.com/movies/sia-defends-movie-music-against-critics-autism-representation/&#10;https://autisticmama.com/do-not-support-autism-speaks/&#10;https://www.themarysue.com/sia-music-film-response/&#10;https://www.newsweek.com/music-sia-movie-autism-controversy-maddie-ziegler-1569289&#10;https://www.themarysue.com/sias-music-film-worse-than-cats/&#10;https://www.cnn.com/2021/01/04/entertainment/sia-maddie-ziegler-trnd/index.html&#10;https://www.themarysue.com/sia-music-film-criticism/&#10;https://www.themarysue.com/sia-music-film-response/&#10;https://www.pajiba.com/celebrities_are_better_than_you/the-problem-with-sia-and-her-use-of-her-muse-maddie-ziegler.php&#10;https://www.nme.com/news/music/sia-reflects-on-responding-to-criticism-of-her-film-music-i-should-have-just-shut-up-2843167&#10;https://www.integratedtreatmentservices.co.uk/blog/sensory-intolerance-in-autism/&#10;&#10;&#10004; OTHER PLATFORMS &#10004;&#10;Twitch: https://www.twitch.tv/jessiegender&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#10;&#10;&#10004; SHOP &#10004;&#10;Book that I Helped Write: https://bit.ly/39EqtP4&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#10;&#10;&#10004; SOCIAL MEDIA &#10004;&#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/jessiegende...&#8203; &#10;Twitter: https://twitter.com/jessiegender&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203; &#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/jessie.gende...&#8203;&#10;&#10;&#10004; OTHER PROJECTS &#10004;&#10;What the Frell podcast w/Council of Geeks: https://councilofgeeks.libsyn.com/&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#10;&#10;&#10004; CONTACT &#10004;&#10;E-mail: jearl1892@gmail.com&#10;Mail: Jessie Earl&#10;PO BOX 85787"
