    id 389
    label "A_Q-8zxvTNk"
    step 0
    date "2022-05-20T12:02:42Z"
    title "1 hour flight with our daughter Rocket whos diagnosed with ASD or Autism Spectrum Disorder"
    description "So we recently shared that our daughter Rocket has ASD or Autism spectrum disorder. She loves the outdoors, including the beach and the sea but travelling can be a bit tricky. She can cry and shout at anytime during the flight and can be challenging to calm her. We bring lots of blocks, puzzles and other activities hoping that'll keep her busy and comfortable. Today was one of the best flights we've had. No crying this time, because she slept on Mommy's lap.&#10;&#10;#AubreyMiles #TroyMontero #LivinWithTroyAndAubrey #Flight &#10;-----&#10;Be part of our lives, be part of Livin&#8217; With Troy and Aubrey! Join us, Troy, Aubrey, Maurie, Hunter, and Rocket, as we jumpstart this new adventure as a family. Stay tuned for planting hacks, home DIYs, healthy lifestyle tips, and many more! &#10;&#10;Let&#8217;s stay connected:&#65533;Aubrey&#8217;s Instagram - https://www.instagram.com/milesaubrey&#8203;...&#10;Troy&#8217;s Instagram - https://www.instagram.com/troymontero&#8203;...&#10;For inquires contact tmonterosocial@gmail.com"
    channeltitle "Livin&#8217; With Troy and Aubrey"
