    id 390
    label "TwyMybGVF9M"
    step 0
    date "2021-04-02T11:00:25Z"
    title "30 Autistic Creators - World Autism Awareness Day 2021"
    description "Today I wanted to share 30 Autistic Creators for world autism awareness day 2021 for you to take a look at, watch and share their content.  The list includes not just autistic youtubers but autistic tiktok creators, autistic bloggers, autistic instagram creators etc. To clarify, including someone in this video doesn't mean I approve or support everything they do or say. Also if I have not included someone, definitely let me know in the comments &#10;&#10;World Autism Awareness Week 2021 playlist: https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLU7asIuC9SU9VvZVSi3S5sgZA-q84BnWz&#10;&#10;Autistic Creators:&#10;James Sinclair (Autistic &#38; Unapologetic) - https://autisticandunapologetic.com/&#10;&#10;Yo Samdy Sam - https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCk5aCrQAppGZ8atiOpgYZ1A &#10;&#10;Stephanie Bethany - https://www.youtube.com/user/YoureAGreenLlama &#10;&#10;Aspergers From The Inside - https://www.youtube.com/c/AspergersfromtheInside &#10;&#10;NeuroClastic - https://neuroclastic.com/ &#10;&#10;Purple Ella - https://www.youtube.com/user/purplemumify &#10;&#10;Aspergers Growth - https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCJr76B0ZPGNGEHvZHCenSdg &#10;&#10;The Thoughty Auti Podcast: https://anchor.fm/thoughtyauti &#10;&#10;Flappy Hands &#38; Stims - https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCpb_7jiDJMXrGDXyFJ0PJsg &#10;&#10;Actually Aspling - IG: https://www.instagram.com/actuallyaspling/?hl=en &#10;Actually Aspling Wordpress: https://actuallyaspling.wordpress.com/ &#10;&#10;Thislineismine (TikTok) - https://www.tiktok.com/@_thislineismine?lang=en &#10;&#10;Autism Academy - https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCVRcOnnNTSql3Zjqutb--dQ &#10;&#10;The Autism Hype (TikTok) - https://www.tiktok.com/@theautismhype?lang=en &#10;&#10;Princess Aspien - https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC2ZkhMUYD37tboIJJgMz-MA &#10;Princess Aspien TikTok: https://www.tiktok.com/@princessaspien?lang=en  &#10;&#10;Tiffany Cavanaugh (TikTok) - https://www.tiktok.com/@tiffanycavanaugh?lang=en &#10;&#10;Rhiannon The Aspie: https://www.instagram.com/rhiannontheautie/?hl=en &#10;&#10;BenWeiss2001 (TikTok) - https://www.tiktok.com/@benweiss2001?lang=en &#10;&#10;Holistic Autistic - https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCcmNGWegARST_RMi2s5Gdng &#10;Holistic Autistic TikTok: https://www.tiktok.com/@holisticautistic?lang=en &#10;&#10;Paige Layle (TikTok) - https://www.tiktok.com/@paigelayle?lang=en &#10;&#10;The Aspie World - https://www.youtube.com/user/AspieWorld1 &#10;&#10;Jen Msumba (Rebranding Autism) - https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCkrQAGJxuxInf5jNSRfrsyw &#10;&#10;Hunter Hanson (The Life Autistic) - https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCxyGdIDgSyXnhKlnrC88S0A  &#10;&#10;AutiSIMSara - https://www.youtube.com/user/WiwyWish &#10;&#10;Sez Francis - https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCEGrCJ075UyDw-PRObU5eQw &#10;&#10;Rubyofmyeye (TikTok) - https://www.tiktok.com/@rubyofmyeye?lang=en &#10;&#10;Neurodivergent Franchfries - https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC1Bj6fQNKPAR-EB0RpwEaQw &#10;&#10;Autienelle - https://www.instagram.com/autienelle/?hl=en &#10;&#10;21andsensory - https://21andsensory.wordpress.com/ &#10;21andsensory IG: https://www.instagram.com/21andsensory/?hl=en &#10;&#10;Neurodivergent Rebel - https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCdaQVw-dxYuZb2GXHL7LSjA &#10;&#10;AutisticTyla - https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCGQ78cJiMcJhMbpKhjunAxg &#10;&#10;&#128276; Subscribe here for more videos: https://bit.ly/2p6hwcb&#10;&#11093;&#65039; Last video: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OVI3bCLW-HA&#38;list=PLU7asIuC9SU9VvZVSi3S5sgZA-q84BnWz&#38;index=4&#10;&#128073; Are you new to the channel? Check out these videos: https://bit.ly/2xjyG6Q&#10;&#128073; More Autism Videos? https://bit.ly/2Xw0R1n&#10;&#128073; Latest IndieAndy videos: https://bit.ly/2REegkt&#10;&#10;Become a channel member to get access to perks:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCR-fiMOz0Ot2x3bwA-_mS0A/join&#10;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;Find all my social media here OR search IndieAndyUK:&#10;https://linktr.ee/indieandy&#10;&#10;All music by Epidemic Sound, help support by using my referral link: https://www.epidemicsound.com/referral/z6lz3w/&#10;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;&#128231;: indieandyofficial@gmail.com&#10;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;*ABOUT ME*&#10;Hello indie people, I'm Andy and I have Autism Spectrum Disorder (ASD). I make videos on autism from the perspective of an autistic adult. Sharing my autism experiences to help other autistic people and autism families to improve their understanding of autism.&#10;&#10;This channel is focused on raising autism awareness &#38; acceptance of autism. To try and change attitudes towards autism, to educate people about autism for those who are new to the autism world.&#10;&#10;So if you are on the spectrum, know someone with autism, or are working professionally in the autism field and want to learn more about autistic people then consider subscribing and turning on the notification bell to see all future videos. &#10;&#10;#autisticcreators #indieandy #worldautismday"
