    title "How to work on Childs speech | Autism Parents Experience"
    description "&#34;No one else can do, what the Parents can do for their child&#34; &#10;This is a series of videos, where we are sharing our learnings and experiences that we gained, while seeing our child &#34;SAINYAM&#34; recovering from the challenges that came along with Autism Spectrum. &#10;In this video we are introducing sainyam to you for the first time, we are sharing about how to work on child&#8217;s connection with the surrounding and his/ her speech using audio visual learning and certain other tools, which helped Sainyam a lot. &#10;Do watch the videos till the end to gain maximum information. &#10;Stay tuned and don't miss the upcoming videos. &#10;For more information on autism do visit other videos at the channel. &#10;Also check the social stories for the benefit of your child: &#10;Parents Role in dealing with Child's Autism &#10;Can Autism be cured?&#10;The musical journey of Sainyam.&#10;How to handle bullying?&#10;What is good touch?&#10;What to do when you feel nervous and many more... &#10;#autismsuccessstory#autismtherapies#autismparentsexperiences#autismcure"
