    title "Autism and Making People Laugh"
    description "The never ending quest of renovating an older home and making it your own. We are more than halfway there with the before and afters of making over our house, we just have to stick the course! We talk a bit about how autism affects our life as a family and a unique trait that a lot of people with autism have. Autism and making people laugh.&#10;YESTERDAY'S VIDEO: https://youtu.be/HbVX2STQY-U&#10;Hadar, Andrea, Rafael, Abigail, Kitty &#38; Rudy!&#10;Our Mailing Address: 2375 NE 25th Ave #313 Ocala, FL 34470&#10;Thank you for supporting our life-changing move to America! https://www.patreon.com/FoolyLiving&#10;Vlogging Camera We Use: http://amzn.to/2IKpVHx&#10;https://www.amazon.com/shop/ineedmorelives &#10;Use this link to shop Amazon and help our family out! It costs you nothing extra, but helps us out a lot!&#10;Rafael's c-section Birth Vlog: http://youtu.be/2x-cP_jvDYM&#10;Abigail's c-section Birth Vlog: https://youtu.be/pUC_BdL_Xsg&#10;Visit Our Other Channels:&#10;My Weight Loss: http://www.youtube.com/ineedmorelives&#10;Rafael's Channel: FoolyFun&#10;http://www.youtube.com/foolyfun&#10;FoolyCooked Home Channel with Cooking &#38; Cleaning: &#10;http://www.youtube.com/foolycooked&#10;Add Us!:&#10;Facebook: http://www.facebook.com/foolyliving&#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/foolyliving/&#10;#FoolyLiving: http://www.twitter.com/foolyliving&#10;&#10;Our Story&#10;Andrea used to live in Florida, until she met her husband Hadar online on World of Warcraft. We met for the first time in Israel, and got married in America. Andrea moved to Israel and had been living there for 10 years. We are happy to announce that.. Our family just recently moved to AMERICA! We made it! We are a fun loving and happy family. We are not fake family vloggers. You will never see us being fake. Views are not as important to us as our integrity. Many of our family and real life friends watch our videos. You can be assured that what you are seeing is 100% truth and reality. You will not only see the best of us, but the worst of us as well. We all have a story to tell and it's not always pretty. For us, it will always be real. I do not make videos just for you. These are my family's memories. There would be no point in making videos if it weren't the truth. Please remember, when leaving a comment, that we are not characters on a tv show. We are real people.&#10;&#10;About our son: Rafael was diagnosed with #OCD and High Functioning #Autism, also known as #Asperger's syndrome, on the Autism spectrum (ASD). We have a few videos of Rafael so you can understand his diagnosis better:&#10;&#10;DAY IN THE LIFE of a 3 year old with Autism (Aspergers Syndrome): https://youtu.be/-Oyj89ynMNA&#10;&#10;OCD in a 3 year old: https://youtu.be/GPcIrNnsruc&#10;&#10;PLEASE SUBSCRIBE!&#10;NEW VIDEOS EVERY SINGLE DAY!&#10;If you've read this far, the secret phrase is: &#34;FoolyFun we have when we are FoolyLiving.&#34; LEAVE US A COMMENT TO LET US KNOW YOU WERE HERE! &#10;Youtube currently has our comments disabled. We cannot turn them back on. If you'd like to leave us a comment, please go to our community page here:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/user/FoolyLiving/community &#10;&#10;Royalty-Free Music by Kevin MacLeod: incompetech.com&#10;Royalty-Free Music by www.audionautix.com&#10;Royalty-Free Music by Twin Musicom at twinmusicom.org&#10;I work with Amazon as an affiliate. If you need to shop for ANYTHING on Amazon, please use our link before you shop. It does not cost you extra, but it gives us a little bonus, which helps our family out! https://www.amazon.com/shop/ineedmorelives   Thank you!"
    channeltitle "FoolyLiving"
