    description "Are these the best headphones for autism noise cancelling?&#10;&#10;HIKI APP: https://www.hikiapp.com/&#10;&#10;There is a lot of people trying to find the perfect autism headphones why? Let me explain.&#10;&#10;Autism comes with sensory processing disorder, this can make autistic people sensitive to sounds.&#10;&#10;Lots of the time too much noise can be overloading and causes a meltdown for autism people.&#10;&#10;So it stands to reason why a good pair of noise cancelling headphones can be life changing.&#10;&#10;These headphones hit the mark, they are super comfy and really do block out noise!  &#10;&#10;For the price point and the actual practical impact of blocking out noise this is a good purchase.&#10;&#10;However the only downside is they are hard to get use to the buttons and navigation (turning noise cancelling on and off).&#10;&#10;Let me know what your thoughts are on this in the comments below and follow @The Aspie World  for more autism content.&#10;&#10;HASH TAGS:&#10;#Autism   #Aspergers   #ASD&#10;&#10;LINKS:&#10;The Aspie World- BEST Noise Cancelling Headphones For Autism (Which Do YOU Need!?): https://youtu.be/48UhZAW3hdA&#10;&#10;Yo Samdy Sam - AUTISM life hacks - 10 things you should try: https://youtu.be/_JAHy4BdgPE&#10;&#10;The 6 Best Headphones for Children with Autism - Hidden - https://hiddentalentsaba.com/autism-headphones/&#10;&#10;16 Comfortable Autism Noise Canceling Headphones - https://theabilitytoolbox.com/autism-noise-canceling-headphones-earplugs/"
