    id 457
    label "vT5IiMnRBy0"
    step 0
    date "2020-10-11T08:30:02Z"
    title "A sneak peek of our new Autism friendly home...."
    description "Take a look at how we&#8217;re making our new Autism-friendly home. I talk about what an Autism-friendly home means to me and how you can make your home Autism-friendly too. Watch this video to find out cheap and easy-to-follow modifications you can do to your home to help your Autistic child. You'll also learn about the disabled facilities grant, how to get VAT relief, and choosing the right products (lights, doors, tiles, etc) for your child's sensory needs. &#10;&#10;&#10;If you're new to my channel, welcome to the family and thank you for watching our video! Here's a little bit about me, I am a wife, a mother of three beautiful children (Dylan, Luca and Naia) and a former actress. Following my eldest son (Dylan)'s diagnosis of ASC, I threw myself into knowing all there was to know about Autism and how to help him. After 6 years of research, I wrote my first book 'Coming Home to Autism', with my friend and speech therapist, Rhian Grounds. My mission is to help support and inspire parents of special needs children!&#10;&#10;&#10;Please feel free to write in our comment section if you'd like to share your story or if have any questions regarding Autism. &#10;&#10;&#10;For more tips on how to make your home Autism-friendly, check out our previous episodes:&#10;https://youtu.be/8F9dnnwKJcs - Autism Friendly Home&#10;https://youtu.be/QHXeIdQx9LQ - Autism and Sleep&#10;https://youtu.be/rQXu7Nlt-ag - Inside My Autistic Son's Bedroom&#10;&#10;_____________________________________________________________&#10;'Coming Home to Autism' book:&#10;https://www.amazon.co.uk/Coming-Home-Autism-Room-Room/dp/1785924362&#10;&#10;&#10;Social media:&#10;Instagram - http://instagram.com/taraleniston&#10;Facebook - http://facebook.com/cominghometoautism&#10;Website - http://cominghometoautism.com/&#10;&#10;&#10;Business enquiries:&#10;info@cominghometoautism.com&#10;&#10;&#10;Video Producer: &#10;Tiara Westlake https://www.kamukami.com/&#10;&#10;Edit Assistant:&#10;Louise Chivers&#10;&#10;&#10;Music:&#10;Cold Funk by Kevin MacLeod http://incompetech.com&#10;Creative Commons &#8212; Attribution 4.0 International &#8212; CC BY 4.0&#10;Free Download / Stream: https://bit.ly/cold-funk&#10;Music promoted by Audio Library https://youtu.be/Vhd6Kc4TZls&#10;&#10;Found You - Atch https://soundcloud.com/atch-music&#10;Creative Commons &#8212; Attribution 3.0 Unported &#8212; CC BY 3.0&#10;Free Download / Stream: http://bit.ly/_found-you&#10;Music promoted by Audio Library https://youtu.be/vlTLsmc5MCQ&#10;&#10;Summertime by Tokyo Music Walker https://soundcloud.com/user-356546060&#10;Creative Commons &#8212; Attribution 3.0 Unported &#8212; CC BY 3.0&#10;Free Download / Stream: https://bit.ly/al-summertime&#10;Music promoted by Audio Library https://youtu.be/NLSaDjwnX9E&#10;__________________________________________________________________"
