    description "Does the full moon have a sensory effect on people? Maybe?! Let me know your experience with this in the comments. The old jump-in-the-pool-cause-it's-funny trick is back...it puts a smile on my face, gets her some exercise, and she has a great time doing it so it is what it is. &#10;&#10;-Merch Links-&#10;https://teespring.com/stores/fathering-autism&#10;http://fatheringautism.storenvy.com/&#10;-Sensory Floor Tiles- https://cobyandbam.com/?ref=iwvVWPtqblJKZ&#10;20% OFF With Code: fatheringautism&#10;-Autism Parenting Magazine- https://bit.ly/autismparentmag&#10;-Amazon Links- (affiliate link)&#10;https://www.amazon.com/shop/fatheringautism&#10;-You Need This App- Abridge https://abridgeapp.com/fatheringautism&#10;-Where My Music Comes From- https://www.epidemicsound.com/referral/g82ju5/&#10;-Isaiah's Photography Website- https://whatsthepointnshoot.com/prints&#10;-Patreon- https://www.patreon.com/FatheringAutism&#10;-The Podcast- https://anchor.fm/fromamtopm&#10;-Priscilla's Cooking Channel- https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCYssOGi-0ju6UJ3cUZIzeWA&#10;-Isaiah's Channel- https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC5mC7Y8J9I3zZaiBXn83YhA&#10;-Priscilla's Makeup Page- https://www.facebook.com/lipstickmamamakeup&#10;-Twitch - https://www.twitch.tv/papamaass&#10;&#10;-OUR SOCIAL MEDIA-&#10;-Facebook- https://www.facebook.com/FatheringAutismYouTube/&#10;-TikTok- FatheringAutism&#10;-Twitter- @fatheringautism&#10;-My Instagram- @fatheringautism1 &#10;-Isaiah&#8217;s Instagram- @whats_the_pointnshoot &#10;-Priscilla's Instagram- @cillasstuff_n_things&#10;-Priscilla's TikTok- @priscillamaass&#10;-Isaiah and Summer's TikTok- @summerandisaiah"
