    description "The family and I went to the cinema, but this experience was a little different as @VOX Cinemas and Dubai Autism Center have partnered to bring sensory friendly screenings to cinema's across the UAE. &#10;&#10;These screenings create an experience that&#8217;s designed make people with sensory needs and their families feel inclusive, safe, and comfortable when they visit the cinema.&#10;&#10;As a family we can truly say is that nothing makes us happier than when places go that extra mile to make people feel comfortable and included. &#10;Much love and God bless &#10084;&#10;&#10;CLICK HERE TO SUBSCRIBE FOR MORE VIDEOS: https://www.youtube.com/khalidalameri?sub_confirmation=1&#10;&#10;FOLLOW US HERE:&#10;Our Tik Tok: https://vm.tiktok.com/HgGfPA&#10;Salama's Snapchat: https://www.snapchat.com/add/salamaskin&#10;Salama's Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/salamamohamed&#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/khalidalameri&#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/khalidalameri&#10;&#10;MUSIC:&#10;Ikson https://soundcloud.com/ikson&#10;Vlad Gluschenko https://soundcloud.com/vgl9"
