    id 486
    label "bf-N621L8GI"
    step 0
    date "2020-07-25T02:34:49Z"
    title "Autism kids bicycle tips #Autismmom #"
    description "Autism kids bicycle tips, this video has the tips about helping Autism kids to raid bicycle on their own. ASD kids always has the challenges with balance and coordination but with some clear strategy children would be able to make some significant improvement. Our long wait paid of this year, Vinnava started raiding cycle on his own. Hope this helps the parents.&#10;#RidingBicycle #Autismmom #&#2950;&#2975;&#3021;&#2975;&#3007;&#2970;&#2990;&#3021;&#2949;&#2993;&#3007;&#2997;&#3019;&#2990;&#3021;&#10;https://www.amazon.ca/Balance-Buddy-31264002-Adjustable/dp/B000MISWIW&#10;&#10;https://www.amazon.com/LIANCHI-Children-Cycling-Trainer-Balance/dp/B073W4DC6J/ref=mp_s_a_1_2_sspa?dchild=1&#38;keywords=balance+buddy&#38;qid=1595650453&#38;sr=8-2-spons&#38;psc=1&#38;spLa=ZW5jcnlwdGVkUXVhbGlmaWVyPUExNlc1M1A5NlRVMkNFJmVuY3J5cHRlZElkPUEwNDE0NDgxMTVKUjNJMElLTDROWSZlbmNyeXB0ZWRBZElkPUEwMDIzNDczMlczS0xJRTZYWkxWOCZ3aWRnZXROYW1lPXNwX3Bob25lX3NlYXJjaF9hdGYmYWN0aW9uPWNsaWNrUmVkaXJlY3QmZG9Ob3RMb2dDbGljaz10cnVl&#10;&#10;&#10;Please Subscribe My Channel for More Videos &#10;http://www.youtube.com/c/Iamanautismmom&#10;&#10;Email your queries to iamanautismmom@gmail.com&#10;&#10;This channel about autism awareness and share the personal experience regarding parenting .. &#10;My elder son is my inspiration behind this idea to create a channel and post videos about our experience and the hurdles which we pass through at each stage and age. We sharing how we face and pass through each stage and tips to help parents who are going through this. I am not a certified therapist or a pediatrician but a mom who is trying to bring my kid on his own. I hope this will benefit parents who are having kids diagnosed with autism as well as to parents who wants to understand what autism is and the challenges behind it. &#10;Keep watching our channel to understand our journey with Autism and tips that might help you. If you have any queries, please let me know in the comments or contact us through social media. &#10;Please share this to your friends and families who need this. we are not providing any cure tips here. Our videos will give scope and confident to bring up the kids.&#10;Thank you for your support!&#10;&#128266; LIKE &#10145; SHARE &#10145; SUBSCRIBE&#10;&#9658; Subscribe For more:&#10;&#128512; Follow/Like Us Socially &#128512;&#10;&#9658;Face book: https://www.facebook.com/Kavidiva/&#10;&#9658;Twitter: https://twitter.com/Iamanautismmom1&#10;&#9658;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/kavithadivagar&#10;&#10;#Autism #Autismmom #AutismTamil #AutismHomeBasedTherapyTamil2020 #imausome&#10;#Iamanautismmom #AutismTherapyinTamilbyAutismmom #autismkidsbrother #AutismJourney withAutistickid #autismkidparenting #autismintamil #autismspectrumdisordertamil#autism2020 #autismexplainedintamil #autismrecoveryintamil #whatisautismtamil #homebasedabatherapy #HomeBasedTherapyTamil #Autismparenting #Autism Father #AutismVLog #AutismParentingvLog #AutismTamilVlog #IamanautismmomvLog #ToysReviewitamil #autismpuzzler #littlepuzzler&#10;#Austimmom #RidingBicycle"
