    id 501
    label "qIJvedobutY"
    step 0
    date "2021-12-29T16:00:10Z"
    title "Autistic non verbal girl throwing up! | Autism life with Ashy"
    description "Welcome to Autism life with Ashy! Ashlyn is an 12 year old Autistic non verbal girl in the spectrum. We upload at least 2-3 times a week. Follow our journey. &#10;&#10;Watch my sister Aliyah&#8217;s graduation video here &#11015;&#65039;&#10;https://youtu.be/SkS5wELHQW8&#10;&#10;Watch my sister Aliz&#233; graduation video here &#11015;&#65039;&#10;https://youtu.be/5Rgm1MXgoYI&#10;&#10;Watch how Ashy did with her mask out in public!&#10;https://youtu.be/fi8PH9URH3Y&#10;&#10;Ashy is in most of our vlogmas videos. Watch our Vlogmas playlist. &#10;&#10;https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLlo5uav60TI1g-JptsRVYdMrtFfqvDJoU&#10;&#10;Disclaimer: I am speaking for/about Ashlyn. However the Autism spectrum Disorder is big and everyone is different. &#10;&#10;Please Like, comment, share and subscribe. Help us spread Autism Awareness around the world.&#10;&#10;Here&#8217;s more about Ashy!&#10;https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLlo5uav60TI1q61VxXZY2YNSPyiP9h8bs &#10;&#10;Find more about Ashy in our Family channel:&#10;https://youtu.be/cWRdCdir5Ck&#10;&#10;Shop our boutique https://garciasroyaltyboutique.com/&#10;&#10;YouTube Channels:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCVbwCr2CiPXEr7qw8NWZ5GA&#10;&#10;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCAnLRNeDKVqFzvc0ozv-s3Q&#10;&#10;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCOfo8861FUJdVxJdQqwuNEA&#10;&#10;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCJP_Sb4uhIhIWfcWik8Vhew&#10;&#10;Let&#8217;s get social Follow us on IG:&#10;&#10;https://instagram.com/thegarciasroyaltyfamily?igshid=1ti2g6upy16pp&#10;&#10;https://instagram.com/garciasroyaltyboutique?igshid=1nhxc8aow3pyb&#10;&#10;https://instagram.com/mrs.igarcia?igshid=12gpmro67eyxf&#10;&#10;https://instagram.com/alize.cristal?igshid=1vlcjdlo60nln&#10;&#10;https://instagram.com/ashlyns_autism_journey?igshid=19djn2o6kmi1i&#10;&#10; https://instagram.com/aliyahbgarcia?igshid=s2o18ds4sfv3&#10;&#10;https://instagram.com/allysha_pauline?igshid=1xbha0f21kxk4&#10;&#10;TikTok: https://vm.tiktok.com/ZM