    date "2022-07-06T02:58:15Z"
    title "Npestas talk about having autism, and how it might effect his future"
    description "NPESTA IF YOU WANT ME TO DELETE THIS, I WILL ON THE SPOT DELETE IT.&#10;&#10;Genuinely from the bottom of my heart, this situation and all similar really suck, and I only wish the best for Npesta, and EVERYONE in similar situations because we're living in a time where we are getting rude awakenings to everything happening in the world, and it's important we don't let them go unheard.&#10;&#10;I am posting this not only because I feel many, just like myself, will want to know what is going on with Npesta of course, but also because it's important to be aware that the talking head behind the camera or screen or whatever isn't just a talking head, and often recently we have been made aware of this, sad as it is.&#10;&#10;I truly, TRULY hope that cures are found for every single physically damaging thing in the world, and mental, and of course I hope everyone as myself feel the same way, because so many really good people are given the worst luck in the world, like Techno, and many children with cancer, like George Floyd, Ahmaud Arbury, Brianna Taylor, and countless other victims of police brutality, like anyone who has a mental illness like depression, anxiety, PTSD, you name it, for anyone and EVERYONE around the world to have access to, no matter how rich or poor, regardless or race or gender or sexuality or ANYTHING THAT SHOULDNT HAVE MEANT ANYTHING TO BEGIN WITH. That's my piece, again Npesta I'm really sorry if you didn't want this posted I will take it down IMMEDIATELY if so, and yea."
