    step 0
    date "2021-06-23T18:21:09Z"
    title "Early Signs Of Autism In Urdu/Hindi | What Is Autism In Urdu | Autism Kya Hai | Autism Ki Alamat"
    description "Early Signs Of Autism In Urdu/Hindi | What Is Autism In Urdu | Autism Kya Hai | Autism Ki Alamat&#10;&#10;Autism is a developmental disability that causes behavioral and social problems. Generally, the symptoms of autism appear in the first two years of life and parents are the first ones who realize that there is a problem with their child. People with autism show repetitive behavior,  inconsistent eye contact, restricted interests, difficulty in communication. The exact cause of these symptoms is not known yet. Early assessment of this problem is very important so that diagnosis can be made and treatment can begin.&#10;&#10;In this video, Dr. Ayesha Rashid, a Consultant Psychiatrist, is going to explain Autism in detail. She discusses its symptoms that are majority shown by an autistic child.&#10;&#10;To find more details, book an appointment, or take online consultation with Dr. Ayesha Rasheed through this website:  https://www.marham.pk/doctors/lahore/psychiatrist/prof-dr-ayesha-rasheed or call 03111222398.&#10;&#10;MARHAM Website: https://www.marham.pk/&#10;Marham on Twitter: https://twitter.com/marhampk &#10;Marham on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/marham.pk/ &#10;&#10;Download the Marham App:&#10;&#10;Android: https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=controllers.marham.marhammed&#38;hl=en&#10;IOS:  https://itunes.apple.com/pk/app/marham-find-a-doctor/id1095243102?mt=8&#10;&#10;#Autism #Marham"
