    title "My Autism Diagnosis Meeting | Sheepdog Says"
    description "Another big installment in Sheepdog Says milestones!&#10;&#10;I had my autism diagnosis meeting today where the doctor talked to me and my sister about my childhood and my general life to date, it was a 2ish hour interview about me, split into thirds which he graded according to a specific score where above X = autistic.&#10;&#10;My sister text me during the break apologizing for how often she had to say things that made me sound rather selfish/thoughtless/rude etc but I understood the point of the questions and what she had to answer was true so like, no issues haha. It was a bizarre experience all round."
