    title "A must watch for EVERY PARENT @Mommy in the house #mustwatch"
    description "@Mommy in the house &#10;&#10;DISCLAIMER :All the information provided on this channel and its videos are for helping purposes only and should not be considered as professional advice as I am a mom documenting the journey of my Autism baby and the measures we have been taking to help him transition and become socially functional. We are trying to provide perfect ,valid, specific, and detailed information. All the contents published on our channel are our research and self tested. &#10;Please do not use any picture and video of our family for any usage on your channel or social media platform without our permission in any way to avoid any legal action.&#10;&#10;Hello My Autism Family,&#10;&#10;I am hoping that you will like this video. Subscribe, like and Share our channel and help us spread Autism awareness &#128522;&#10;&#10;&#10084;&#10004;  Instagram. (to chat) &#10;Kindly follow if  you wish your message to reach me otherwise the message will go to hidden request due to privacy settings later you may unfollow as per your wish&#10;&#10; https://www.instagram.com/ina_chawla/&#10;&#10084;&#10004;  Facebook (only for updates) https://www.facebook.com/AforAutismbyIna&#10;&#10;Viraj and new baby Vlog Page - https://www.facebook.com/mommyinthehouse&#10;&#10;Never quit when tired , take rest and then get back to work!&#10;&#10;Regards&#10;Ina, Autism Mom&#10;&#10;#sensoryintegrationtherapyathome #occupationaltherapyathome&#10;#autism #autismsymptoms #autismfamilyvlogs #autismsuccessstory #autismsymptoms #autismawareness #autismmom #virtualautism #aforautism #autismfamilyvlogs #autismsymptoms #autismawareness#developmentaldelay#autismsymptoms #speechdelay #languagedevelopment #parentingtips #aforautism #sittingtolerance #school #nurseryclasssyllabus #nurseryrhymes"
