    id 544
    label "6TR5coz1w4E"
    step 0
    date "2022-07-12T13:12:19Z"
    title "From Autism to Aspergers to Success"
    description "I met Joey and someone told me he has Autism growing up. I was shocked because I had no idea he had anything growing up. He was confident, funny, talkative, and a great kid to be around.. He actually was the life of the party anywhere we would go. &#10;&#10;My biggest takeaway from doing this podcast with him is your environment is everything ESPECIALLY for kids growing up. Bullying and name calling can ruin someone's upbringing and make a medical condition even worst. &#10;Support and love from people around you can make a medical condition vanish and become unknown. &#10;&#10;Make sure that if you see anyone in your life struggling medically or just naturally you are the person to support them and help lift them up and not put them down because you can create another Joey. His life could have went two ways and we are blessed and fortunate it is going in the uplifting way of success, love, and a fulfilled life. &#10;&#10;#Autism #AcezMotivation #AcezAcademy"
    channeltitle "Acez Academy"
