    title "Getting out of the Autism Nightmare"
    description "Mark's experience in both worlds.&#10;&#10;Mark and Michelle Hedges have been married 28 years. For the first 19 years of the marriage, Mark was undiagnosed autistic. In 2013 they went on the GAPS Diet for 6 years and then in 2018 the Medical Medium protocol to heal Michelle's autoimmune issues and heal Mark's autism. &#10;&#10;In late 2020 Michelle picked up a pendulum and was suddenly able to help the entire family heal from knowing rather than guessing.&#10;&#10;To purchase books and readings, go to www.12thlightuniversity.com/store&#10;&#10;Follow us on Instagram and Facebook @healyourautism for autism related information. For weirder stuff, follow @12thlightu."
